<section class="site-container site-story-grid">
    <article class="site-story-card"><p class="site-eyebrow">01 / THE PROBLEM</p><h2>Long lessons.<br>Wandering minds.</h2><p>Some students have difficulty staying focused during long lessons or while reading lengthy study materials.</p><div class="site-paper-stack" aria-hidden="true"><span>NOTES<br>────────<br>────────<br>────────<br>────────</span><span>MORE NOTES<br>────────<br>────────<br>────────</span></div></article>
    <article class="site-story-card site-story-card--dark"><p class="site-eyebrow">02 / OUR SOLUTION</p><h2>Less at once.<br>More that sticks.</h2><p>EduFocus allows students to upload PDF lessons and turn them into:</p><ul class="site-checklist"><li>Visual summaries</li><li>Flashcards</li><li>Short reading materials</li><li>Interactive quizzes</li></ul><p>The platform also includes focus and study tools such as Pomodoro sessions, progress tracking, and rewards.</p></article>
</section>
<section class="site-container site-goal"><p class="site-eyebrow">03 / OUR GOAL</p><h2>Make learning<br>feel manageable.</h2><p class="site-lead">Help students study in shorter, manageable sessions while making learning more interactive.</p><a class="site-button" href="{{ auth()->check() ? route('dashboard') : url('/register') }}">Find your focus <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
<section class="site-container site-info-grid">
    <article id="contact"><p class="site-eyebrow">LET’S KEEP IMPROVING</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>EduFocus is a student study project. For questions, feedback, or help with your account, contact the project team through your class or school’s project channel.</p></article>
    <article id="privacy"><p class="site-eyebrow">YOUR STUDY SPACE</p><h2>Privacy</h2><p>Your account details identify your study space. Uploaded lessons are accessible through your signed-in account, and you can delete them from your library. Timer settings are saved in this browser; completed focus sessions, study streaks, and PDF pages you view are saved to your account. The current version does not send PDFs to an external AI service.</p></article>
